WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:21.190
Ground support confirmed before propulsion demand is enabled.

00:00:21.190 --> 00:01:19.013
Takeoff driven by the coupled Simulink powertrain.

00:01:19.013 --> 00:01:49.285
Forward acceleration and climb with native propulsion feedback.

00:01:49.285 --> 00:01:57.635
Cruise with fuel-cell and battery power sharing.

00:01:57.635 --> 00:03:13.700
A lateral detour clears a known static obstacle.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:04:03.879
Forward speed is reduced before the landing approach.

00:04:03.879 --> 00:05:28.813
Controlled descent with reduced vertical speed near the ground.

00:05:28.813 --> 00:05:50.233
Ground contact is followed by disarm and motor-power decay.
